      <title>Vermont lawmakers approve bill requiring disclosure of deceptive AI in political ads</title>
      <link>https://www.vermontpublic.org/local-news/2026-02-18/vermont-lawmakers-approve-bill-disclosure-deceptive-ai-political-ads</link>
      <description>The legislation, which still needs the governor's approval, wouldn't limit how AI video or audio can be used in political ads. Instead, it would require a disclosure if AI is being used to deceive the audience.</description>
